     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Tahoma;color:#000000;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<div>Dear all,</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>here is a potentially interesting job advertisement. At the Swiss ornithological institute at Sempach/Switzerland, we are looking for a person to develop and organize an acoustic monitoring program for birds. A significant part of the work will be number\r\n crunching to explore and further develop the algorithms for automatic pattern recognition, presumably followed by some occupancy modeling or similar. The downside, for a large part of the audience in these two lists, is that you must be really fluent in either\r\n German or French and also have some knowledge of the other of these two languages.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><span title=\"unmarked@googlegroups.com\"><a href=\"https://www.vogelwarte.ch/de/vogelwarte/mitarbeit/jobs/wissenschaftliche-mitarbeiterin-/-wissenschaftlicher-mitarbeiter-akustisches-monitoring\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.vogelwarte.ch/de/vogelwarte/mitarbeit/jobs/wissenschaftliche-mitarbeiterin-/-wissenschaftlicher-mitarbeiter-akustisches-monitoring&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792450234045000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0gmZ8RVcNzAF8DQ1t8rE_o\">https://www.vogelwarte.ch/de/vogelwarte/mitarbeit/jobs/wissenschaftliche-mitarbeiterin-/-wissenschaftlicher-mitarbeiter-akustisches-monitoring</a>\r\n<br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Please consider to apply if you qualify and are interested.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Best regards  -- Marc<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">\